window.WIKI_PREVIEWS = {
  "mediography": {
    "title": "Mediografia",
    "excerpt": "As obras que inspiraram Stonetop: jogos, blogs, livros, filmes, séries e podcasts, com uma ressalva sobre seus criadores.",
    "image": null,
    "book": "book1",
    "sections": {
      "immediate-game-influences": {
        "name": "Immediate game influences",
        "html": "<h2 id=\"immediate-game-influences\">Influências diretas de jogo</h2>\n<p>As obras a seguir inspiraram diretamente as mecânicas, as técnicas, a ambientação, os temas e a abordagem de design de informação de <em>Stonetop</em>.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li><em><a href=\"https://www.dungeon-world.com/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Dungeon World\">Dungeon World</a></em>, Adam Koebel e Sage LaTorra, Sage Kobold Productions, 2012</li><li><em><a href=\"https://lumpley.games/apocalypseworld/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"lumpley games\">Apocalypse World</a></em>, D. Vincent Baker e Meguey Baker, lumpley games, 2010</li><li><em><a href=\"http://lumpley.com/index.php/anyway/thread/392\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"lumpley (anyway)\">Storming the Wizard&#x27;s Tower</a></em>, D. Vincent Baker, inédito, 2008</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/161671/player-s-handbook-4e\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"DriveThruRPG\">Dungeons &amp; Dragons</a></em> (4ª Edição), Rob Heinsoo, Andy Collins e James Wyatt; Wizards of the Coast, 2008</li><li><em><a href=\"https://bladesinthedark.com/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Blades in the Dark\">Blades in the Dark</a></em>, John Harper, Evil Hat Productions, 2017</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.flatlandgames.com/btw/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Flatland Games\">Beyond the Wall and Other Adventures</a></em>, John Cocking e Peter S. Williams, Flatland Games, 2013</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/407161/the-perilous-wilds-revised-edition\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"DriveThruRPG\">The Perilous Wilds</a></em>, Jason Lutes, Lampblack &amp; Brimstone, 2016</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.lampblackandbrimstone.com/store/products/20-dungeon-starters-pdf\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Lampblack &amp; Brimstone\">20 Dungeon Starters</a></em>, Marshall Miller e Mark Tygart, Lampblack &amp; Brimstone, 2016</li><li><em><a href=\"https://trilemma.com/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Trilemma Adventures\">Trilemma Adventures</a></em>, Michael Prescott, Trilemma Adventures, 2019</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.atlas-games.com/arsmagica\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Atlas Games\">Ars Magica</a></em>, Mark Rein-Hagen e Jonathan Tweet, Lion Rampant Games, 1987</li></ul>",
        "kind": "section"
      },
      "blogs": {
        "name": "Blogs",
        "html": "<h2 id=\"blogs\">Blogs</h2>\n<p>Você encontra muitos textos sobre <em>Stonetop</em> e seu desenvolvimento no blog do Jeremy, <em><a href=\"https://spoutinglore.blogspot.com/p/stonetop.html\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Spouting Lore\">Spouting Lore</a></em> (2018-2023). Além disso, os ensaios e séries a seguir influenciaram técnicas e abordagens apresentadas neste jogo ou mostram o jogo em ação.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>&quot;<a href=\"http://mightyatom.blogspot.com/2010/10/apocalypse-world-crossing-line.html\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"The Mighty Atom\"><em>Apocalypse World</em>: Crossing the Line</a>&quot;, John Harper, <em>The Mighty Atom</em>, 2010</li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://www.gauntlet-rpg.com/blog/paint-the-scene\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"The Gauntlet\">Paint the Scene</a>&quot;, Jason Cordova, <em>The Gauntlet Blog</em>, 2018</li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://www.gauntlet-rpg.com/blog/the-7-3-1-technique\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"The Gauntlet\">The 7-3-1 Technique</a>&quot;, Jason Cordova, <em>The Gauntlet Blog</em>, 2018</li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://www.latorra.org/2012/05/15/a-16-hp-dragon/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"LaTorra.org\">A 16 HP Dragon</a>&quot;, Stras Acimovic, republicado por Sage LaTorra, Latorra.org, 2012</li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://lumpley.games/2019/12/30/powered-by-the-apocalypse-part-1/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"lumpley games\">Powered by the Apocalypse</a>&quot; (série em 12 partes), D. Vincent Baker, <em>lumpley games</em>, 2019-2025</li><li><em><a href=\"https://acoup.blog/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"ACOUP\">A Collection of Unmitigated Pedantry</a></em>, Bret Devereaux, 2019-presente (especialmente a série &quot;<a href=\"https://acoup.blog/2019/10/25/collections-practical-polytheism-part-i-knowledge/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"ACOUP\">Practical Polytheism</a>&quot; e a série &quot;<a href=\"https://acoup.blog/2020/09/18/collections-iron-how-did-they-make-it-part-i-mining/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"ACOUP\">Iron, How Did They Make It?</a>&quot;)</li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://thealexandrian.net/wordpress/13085/roleplaying-games/xandering-the-dungeon\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"The Alexandrian\">Xandering the Dungeon</a>&quot;, Justin Alexander, <em>The Alexandrian</em>, 2010</li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://goblinpunch.blogspot.com/2016/01/dungeon-checklist.html\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Goblin Punch\">Dungeon Checklist</a>&quot;, Arnold K., <em>Goblin Punch</em></li><li>&quot;<a href=\"https://ptfo.substack.com/p/table-of-contents\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"PTFO on Substack\">PTFO: Stonetop</a>&quot; (série de actual play solo), SGH, <em>PTFO</em> no Substack, 2022-presente</li></ul>",
        "kind": "section"
      },
      "touchstones": {
        "name": "Touchstones",
        "html": "<h2 id=\"touchstones\">Referências</h2>\n<p>Não há uma única coisa que se possa apontar e dizer &quot;<em>Stonetop</em> é exatamente assim&quot;. Mas aqui vão algumas coisas a que você pode recorrer para pegar o clima.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li><em><a href=\"https://www.netflix.com/title/81024039\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Netflix\">Barbarians</a></em> (série de TV), Andreas Heckmann et al, Gaumont Germany, 2020-2022</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/The-Bear-and-the-Nightingale/dp/0399593284\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Bear and the Nightingale</a></em> (O Urso e o Rouxinol) (livro; e, em menor grau, toda a trilogia <em>Winternight</em>), Katherine Arden, Del Rey, 2017</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Chronicles-Prydain-Lloyd-Alexander/dp/1250000939\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Chronicles of Prydain</a></em> (As Crônicas de Prydain) (série de livros), Lloyd Alexander; Holt, Reinhart, and Winston; 1964-1968</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Dark-Rising-Boxed-Set-Greenwitch/dp/1416949968\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Dark is Rising Sequence</a></em> (série de livros), Susan Cooper, Random House, 1965-1977</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Warded-Man-Book-Demon-Cycle/dp/0345518705\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Demon Cycle</a></em> (série de livros), Peter V. Brett, Penguin Random House, 2010-2017</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Assassins-Apprentice-Illustrated-Farseer-Trilogy/dp/198481785X\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Farseer</a></em> (trilogia de livros), Robin Hobb, Spectra, 1995-1997</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Blade-Itself-First-Law-Trilogy/dp/0316387312\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The First Law</a></em> (série de livros), Joe Abercrombie, Orbit Books, 2006-presente</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Hobbit-J-R-Tolkien/dp/054792822X\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Hobbit</a></em> (O Hobbit) (livro), J.R.R. Tolkien, George Allen &amp; Unwin, 1937</li><li><em><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/352220/King_of_Dragon_Pass/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Steam\">King of Dragon Pass</a></em> (videogame), David Dunham, A Sharp, 1999 (ou qualquer outra coisa relacionada ao cenário de Glorantha, de Greg Stafford (pelo que me dizem))</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.netflix.com/title/80074249\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Netflix\">The Last Kingdom</a></em> (O Último Reino) (série de TV), Stephen Butchard et al, Carnival Film and Television, 2015-2017</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/movies/nausicaa-of-the-valley-of-the-wind/ed66031b-6353-4019-ba54-35488468a4db\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind</a></em> (Nausicaä do Vale do Vento) (filme), Hayao Miyazaki, Studio Ghibli, 1984</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.dc.com/graphic-novels/northlanders-2007/northlanders-book-one-the-anglo-saxon-saga\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"DC Comics\">Northlanders</a></em> (série de quadrinhos), Brian Wood, Vertigo, 2008-2012</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/movies/princess-mononoke/e31c2dc2-cb8b-416e-9eda-769be3bb3a6b\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">Princess Mononoke</a></em> (Princesa Mononoke) (filme), Hayao Miyazaki, Studio Ghibli, 1984</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Redwall-Brian-Jacques/dp/0142302376\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Redwall</a></em> (série de livros), Brian Jacques, Penguin Books, 1986-2011</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/show/16ffed0e-6650-4d35-8c35-96c5b42863cc\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">Rome</a></em> (série de TV), John Milius et al, HBO, 2005-2007</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.justwatch.com/us/movie/the-secret-of-kells\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"JustWatch\">The Secret of Kells</a></em> (O Segredo de Kells) (filme), Tomm Moore e Nora Twomey, Les Armateurs, 2009</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Beguilement-Sharing-Knife-Book-1/dp/0061139076\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Sharing Knife</a></em> (série de livros), Lois McMaster Bujold, HarperCollins, 2006-2019</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Half-King-Shattered-Sea-Abercrombie/dp/0804178410\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Shattered Sea</a></em> (trilogia de livros) Joe Abercrombie, Del Rey, 2014-2015</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.netflix.com/title/70301870\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Netflix\">Vikings</a></em> (série de TV), Michael Hirst, TM Productions et al, 2013-2021</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Wizard-Earthsea-Cycle/dp/0547722028\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">A Wizard of Earthsea</a></em> (O Feiticeiro de Terramar) (livro), Ursula K. Le Guin, Parnassus Press, 1968</li><li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Driftless_Area\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Wikipedia\">The Driftless region of Wisconsin</a> (a região Driftless, em Wisconsin) e o <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas_Hill_Country\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Wikipedia\">Texas Hill Country</a></li></ul>",
        "kind": "section"
      },
      "and-also": {
        "name": "And also...",
        "html": "<h2 id=\"and-also\">E também...</h2>\n<p>As obras a seguir influenciaram ou inspiraram certos elementos específicos de <em>Stonetop</em>, ou ressoam fortemente com alguns de seus temas. Talvez inspirem você também.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hplovecraft.com/writings/texts/fiction/mm.aspx\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"H.P. Lovecraft Archive\">At the Mountains of Madness</a></em> (Nas Montanhas da Loucura) (novela), H.P. Lovecraft, <em>Astounding Stories</em>, 1936 (e outros contos de Lovecraft)</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F7QNRGM\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Black Company</a></em> (série de livros), Glen Cook, 1984-presente, Tor Fantasy</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.justwatch.com/us/tv-show/zone-blanche\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"JustWatch\">Black Spot</a></em> (série de TV), Mathieu Missoffe, Ego Productions et al, 2017-2019</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/movies/cronos/c883948a-cad4-4231-9f02-11a049fa32bb\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">Chronos</a></em> (Cronos) (filme), Guillermo del Toro, Fondo de Fomento Cinematográfico et al, 1992</li><li><a href=\"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Author:Robert_Ervin_Howard\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Wikisource\">The &quot;Conan&quot; stories</a> (os contos de &quot;Conan&quot;; livros e adaptações); Robert E. Howard, L. Sprague de Camp e Lin Carter; várias editoras, 1950-1977 (especialmente &quot;<a href=\"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Red_Nails\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Wikisource\">Red Nails</a>&quot;)</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/shows/deadwood/065d80dc-68c4-4770-8f7b-00279f91c6da\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">Deadwood</a></em> (série de TV), David Milch, Roscoe Productions et al, 2004-2006</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.gauntlet-rpg.com/discern-realities\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"The Gauntlet\">Discern Realities</a></em> (podcast), Jason Cordova e David LaFrieniere, The Gauntlet, 2015-2019</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074C2XKT4\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Gentleman Bastard</a></em> (série de livros), Scott Lynch, Bantam Books, 2006-2013</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.paramountplus.com/movies/video/UAhaBnkT1Lm68ZAFQx1CgMeXalb4vxwz/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Paramount+\">Gladiator</a></em> (Gladiador) (filme), Ridley Scott, DreamWorks Pictures et al, 2000</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Heart-Shaped-Box-Joe-Hill/dp/0061147931\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Heart Shaped Box</a></em> (livro), Joe Hill, William Morrow, 2007</li><li><em><a href=\"https://pelgranepress.com/product/hillfolk/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Pelgrane Press\">Hillfolk</a></em> (RPG), Robin Laws, Pelgrane Press, 2013</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/movies/history-of-violence/5398afdd-7a13-45b3-b9c5-ccdd7be6b8f2\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">A History of Violence</a></em> (Marcas da Violência) (filme), David Cronenberg, BenderSpink et al, 2005</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Jonathan-Strange-Norrell-Susanna-Clarke/dp/1608190862\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Jonathan Strange and Mr Norrell</a></em> (livro), Susanna Clarke, Bloomsbury, 2004</li><li><em><a href=\"https://ufopress.co.uk/product/legacy-life-among-the-ruins-2nd-edition/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"UFO Press\">Legacy: Life Among the Ruins</a></em> (RPG), Minerva McJanda, UFO Press, 2015</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FK5BWFG\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">Little House on the Prairie</a></em> (série de livros), Laura Ingalls Wilder, Harper &amp; Brothers, 1932-1971</li><li><em><a href=\"https://thesword.bandcamp.com/album/low-country\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Bandcamp\">Low Country</a></em> (álbum), The Sword, Razor &amp; Tie, 2016</li><li><em><a href=\"https://rustyquill.com/show/the-magnus-archives/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Rusty Quill\">The Magnus Archives</a></em> (podcast), Jonathan Simms e Alexander J. Newall, Rusty Quill, 2016-2021</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.mouseguard.net/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"mouseguard.net\">Mouse Guard</a></em> (série de quadrinhos), David Petersen, Archaia Studios Press, 2006-presente</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.monsterman.org/monsterman\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"monsterman.org\">Monster Man</a></em> (podcast), James Holloway, 2018-presente</li><li><em><a href=\"https://nocountryforoldkobolds.com/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"nocountryforoldkobolds.com\">No Country for Old Kobolds</a></em> (RPG), Steve Wallace, Steve Wallace Art, 2016</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.oldgodsofappalachia.com/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"oldgodsofappalachia.com\">Old Gods of Appalachia</a></em> (podcast), Steve Shell e Cam Collins, Deepnerd Media, 2019-presente</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.justwatch.com/us/movie/pans-labyrinth\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"JustWatch\">Pan&#x27;s Labyrinth</a></em> (O Labirinto do Fauno) (filme, 2006), Guillermo del Toro, Estudios Picasso et al, 2006</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hulu.com/movie/prey-55349764-323e-4d0e-898f-a4c12c9bf615\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Hulu\">Prey</a></em> (Predador: A Caçada) (filme), Dan Trachtenberg, 20th Century Studios et al, 2022</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.hbomax.com/movie/175d821c-276e-4b5f-9cfd-b2f89db35631\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"HBO Max\">The Revenant</a></em> (O Regresso) (filme), Alejandro González Iñárritu, Regency Enterprises et al, 2015</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.netflix.com/title/80217312\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Netflix\">The Ritual</a></em> (O Ritual) (filme), David Bruckner, The Imaginarium, 2017</li><li><em><a href=\"https://gregor-vuga.itch.io/sagas-of-the-icelanders\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"itch.io\">Sagas of the Icelanders</a></em> (RPG), Gregor Vuga, 2013</li><li><em><a href=\"https://tubitv.com/movies/310149/the-secret-of-nimh\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Tubi\">The Secret of NIMH</a></em> (A Ratinha Valente) (filme), Don Bluth, United Artists, 1982</li><li><em><a href=\"https://lumpley.games/under-hollow-hills/\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"lumpley games\">Under Hollow Hills</a></em> (RPG), Meguey Baker e D. Vincent Baker, lumpley games, 2021</li><li><em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F7LS683\" class=\"ref-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Amazon\">The Wardstone Chronicles</a></em> (série de livros), Joseph Delaney, Greenwillow Books, 2004-2013</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"caveat-emptor\">Caveat emptor</h3>\n<p>Tudo o que está acima é relevante e potencialmente útil como inspiração, mas não é necessariamente tudo bom.</p>\n<p>E alguns dos criadores tinham e defendiam crenças nocivas, o que permeia suas obras. Outros fizeram, ou foram acusados de fazer, coisas terríveis. As pessoas, como a arte e o nosso consumo dela, são complicadas.</p>",
        "kind": "section"
      },
      "caveat-emptor": {
        "name": "Caveat emptor",
        "html": "<h3 id=\"caveat-emptor\">Caveat emptor</h3>\n<p>Tudo o que está acima é relevante e potencialmente útil como inspiração, mas não é necessariamente tudo bom.</p>\n<p>E alguns dos criadores tinham e defendiam crenças nocivas, o que permeia suas obras. Outros fizeram, ou foram acusados de fazer, coisas terríveis. As pessoas, como a arte e o nosso consumo dela, são complicadas.</p>",
        "kind": "section"
      }
    },
    "text": "Mediografia\n Influências diretas de jogo\n As obras a seguir inspiraram diretamente as mecânicas, as técnicas, a ambientação, os temas e a abordagem de design de informação de Stonetop .\n Dungeon World , Adam Koebel e Sage LaTorra, Sage Kobold Productions, 2012\n Apocalypse World , D. Vincent Baker e Meguey Baker, lumpley games, 2010\n Storming the Wizard's Tower , D. Vincent Baker, inédito, 2008\n Dungeons & Dragons (4ª Edição), Rob Heinsoo, Andy Collins e James Wyatt; Wizards of the Coast, 2008\n Blades in the Dark , John Harper, Evil Hat Productions, 2017\n Beyond the Wall and Other Adventures , John Cocking e Peter S. Williams, Flatland Games, 2013\n The Perilous Wilds , Jason Lutes, Lampblack & Brimstone, 2016\n 20 Dungeon Starters , Marshall Miller e Mark Tygart, Lampblack & Brimstone, 2016\n Trilemma Adventures , Michael Prescott, Trilemma Adventures, 2019\n Ars Magica , Mark Rein-Hagen e Jonathan Tweet, Lion Rampant Games, 1987\n Blogs\n Você encontra muitos textos sobre Stonetop e seu desenvolvimento no blog do Jeremy, Spouting Lore (2018-2023). Além disso, os ensaios e séries a seguir influenciaram técnicas e abordagens apresentadas neste jogo ou mostram o jogo em ação.\n \" Apocalypse World : Crossing the Line \", John Harper, The Mighty Atom , 2010\n \" Paint the Scene \", Jason Cordova, The Gauntlet Blog , 2018\n \" The 7-3-1 Technique \", Jason Cordova, The Gauntlet Blog , 2018\n \" A 16 HP Dragon \", Stras Acimovic, republicado por Sage LaTorra, Latorra.org, 2012\n \" Powered by the Apocalypse \" (série em 12 partes), D. Vincent Baker, lumpley games , 2019-2025\n A Collection of Unmitigated Pedantry , Bret Devereaux, 2019-presente (especialmente a série \" Practical Polytheism \" e a série \" Iron, How Did They Make It? \")\n \" Xandering the Dungeon \", Justin Alexander, The Alexandrian , 2010\n \" Dungeon Checklist \", Arnold K., Goblin Punch \n \" PTFO: Stonetop \" (série de actual play solo), SGH, PTFO no Substack, 2022-presente\n Referências\n Não há uma única coisa que se possa apontar e dizer \" Stonetop é exatamente assim\". Mas aqui vão algumas coisas a que você pode recorrer para pegar o clima.\n Barbarians (série de TV), Andreas Heckmann et al, Gaumont Germany, 2020-2022\n The Bear and the Nightingale (O Urso e o Rouxinol) (livro; e, em menor grau, toda a trilogia Winternight ), Katherine Arden, Del Rey, 2017\n The Chronicles of Prydain (As Crônicas de Prydain) (série de livros), Lloyd Alexander; Holt, Reinhart, and Winston; 1964-1968\n The Dark is Rising Sequence (série de livros), Susan Cooper, Random House, 1965-1977\n The Demon Cycle (série de livros), Peter V. Brett, Penguin Random House, 2010-2017\n Farseer (trilogia de livros), Robin Hobb, Spectra, 1995-1997\n The First Law (série de livros), Joe Abercrombie, Orbit Books, 2006-presente\n The Hobbit (O Hobbit) (livro), J.R.R. Tolkien, George Allen & Unwin, 1937\n King of Dragon Pass (videogame), David Dunham, A Sharp, 1999 (ou qualquer outra coisa relacionada ao cenário de Glorantha, de Greg Stafford (pelo que me dizem))\n The Last Kingdom (O Último Reino) (série de TV), Stephen Butchard et al, Carnival Film and Television, 2015-2017\n Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind (Nausicaä do Vale do Vento) (filme), Hayao Miyazaki, Studio Ghibli, 1984\n Northlanders (série de quadrinhos), Brian Wood, Vertigo, 2008-2012\n Princess Mononoke (Princesa Mononoke) (filme), Hayao Miyazaki, Studio Ghibli, 1984\n Redwall (série de livros), Brian Jacques, Penguin Books, 1986-2011\n Rome (série de TV), John Milius et al, HBO, 2005-2007\n The Secret of Kells (O Segredo de Kells) (filme), Tomm Moore e Nora Twomey, Les Armateurs, 2009\n The Sharing Knife (série de livros), Lois McMaster Bujold, HarperCollins, 2006-2019\n Shattered Sea (trilogia de livros) Joe Abercrombie, Del Rey, 2014-2015\n Vikings (série de TV), Michael Hirst, TM Productions et al, 2013-2021\n A Wizard of Earthsea (O Feiticeiro de Terramar) (livro), Ursula K. Le Guin, Parnassus Press, 1968\n The Driftless region of Wisconsin (a região Driftless, em Wisconsin) e o Texas Hill Country \n E também...\n As obras a seguir influenciaram ou inspiraram certos elementos específicos de Stonetop , ou ressoam fortemente com alguns de seus temas. Talvez inspirem você também.\n At the Mountains of Madness (Nas Montanhas da Loucura) (novela), H.P. Lovecraft, Astounding Stories , 1936 (e outros contos de Lovecraft)\n The Black Company (série de livros), Glen Cook, 1984-presente, Tor Fantasy\n Black Spot (série de TV), Mathieu Missoffe, Ego Productions et al, 2017-2019\n Chronos (Cronos) (filme), Guillermo del Toro, Fondo de Fomento Cinematográfico et al, 1992\n The \"Conan\" stories (os contos de \"Conan\"; livros e adaptações); Robert E. Howard, L. Sprague de Camp e Lin Carter; várias editoras, 1950-1977 (especialmente \" Red Nails \")\n Deadwood (série de TV), David Milch, Roscoe Productions et al, 2004-2006\n Discern Realities (podcast), Jason Cordova e David LaFrieniere, The Gauntlet, 2015-2019\n Gentleman Bastard (série de livros), Scott Lynch, Bantam Books, 2006-2013\n Gladiator (Gladiador) (filme), Ridley Scott, DreamWorks Pictures et al, 2000\n Heart Shaped Box (livro), Joe Hill, William Morrow, 2007\n Hillfolk (RPG), Robin Laws, Pelgrane Press, 2013\n A History of Violence (Marcas da Violência) (filme), David Cronenberg, BenderSpink et al, 2005\n Jonathan Strange and Mr Norrell (livro), Susanna Clarke, Bloomsbury, 2004\n Legacy: Life Among the Ruins (RPG), Minerva McJanda, UFO Press, 2015\n Little House on the Prairie (série de livros), Laura Ingalls Wilder, Harper & Brothers, 1932-1971\n Low Country (álbum), The Sword, Razor & Tie, 2016\n The Magnus Archives (podcast), Jonathan Simms e Alexander J. Newall, Rusty Quill, 2016-2021\n Mouse Guard (série de quadrinhos), David Petersen, Archaia Studios Press, 2006-presente\n Monster Man (podcast), James Holloway, 2018-presente\n No Country for Old Kobolds (RPG), Steve Wallace, Steve Wallace Art, 2016\n Old Gods of Appalachia (podcast), Steve Shell e Cam Collins, Deepnerd Media, 2019-presente\n Pan's Labyrinth (O Labirinto do Fauno) (filme, 2006), Guillermo del Toro, Estudios Picasso et al, 2006\n Prey (Predador: A Caçada) (filme), Dan Trachtenberg, 20th Century Studios et al, 2022\n The Revenant (O Regresso) (filme), Alejandro González Iñárritu, Regency Enterprises et al, 2015\n The Ritual (O Ritual) (filme), David Bruckner, The Imaginarium, 2017\n Sagas of the Icelanders (RPG), Gregor Vuga, 2013\n The Secret of NIMH (A Ratinha Valente) (filme), Don Bluth, United Artists, 1982\n Under Hollow Hills (RPG), Meguey Baker e D. Vincent Baker, lumpley games, 2021\n The Wardstone Chronicles (série de livros), Joseph Delaney, Greenwillow Books, 2004-2013\n Caveat emptor\n Tudo o que está acima é relevante e potencialmente útil como inspiração, mas não é necessariamente tudo bom.\n E alguns dos criadores tinham e defendiam crenças nocivas, o que permeia suas obras. Outros fizeram, ou foram acusados de fazer, coisas terríveis. As pessoas, como a arte e o nosso consumo dela, são complicadas."
  }
};
